<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:#f8fafc;padding:2rem;">
<div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;border:1.5px solid #f1f5f9;padding:2rem;">

    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem;">
        <h1 style="color:#1e3a5f;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;">
            Share<span style="color:#1d4ed8;">Trips</span>
        </h1>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <div style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;background:#fee2e2;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.5rem;">
            ✕
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="color:#1e3a5f;font-weight:700;text-align:center;">
        Réservation annulée
    </h2>

    <p style="color:#475569;text-align:center;">
        Bonjour <strong>{{ booking.trip.driver.firstName }}</strong>, le passager 
        <strong>{{ booking.passenger.fullName }}</strong> a annulé sa réservation.
    </p>

    <div style="background:#f1f5f9;border-radius:12px;padding:1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.875rem;">Trajet</span>
            <span style="color:#1e3a5f;font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;">
                {{ booking.trip.origin }} → {{ booking.trip.destination }}
            </span>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:.5rem;">
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.875rem;">Date</span>
            <span style="color:#1e3a5f;font-weight:600;font-size:.875rem;">
                {{ booking.trip.departureAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
            </span>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;">
            <span style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.875rem;">Places libérées</span>
            <span style="color:#1e3a5f;font-weight:700;font-size:.875rem;">
                {{ booking.seatsBooked }} place{{ booking.seatsBooked > 1 ? 's' : '' }}
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background:#fef9c3;border:1.5px solid #fde68a;border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;color:#854d0e;font-size:.875rem;text-align:center;">
        Des places sont à nouveau disponibles sur votre trajet. De nouveaux passagers peuvent réserver.
    </div>

    <p style="color:#64748b;font-size:.85rem;text-align:center;">
        Si vous avez des questions, n'hésitez pas à nous contacter.
    </p>

    <p style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:.8rem;text-align:center;margin-top:2rem;">
        © {{ "now"|date("Y") }} ShareTrips - Tous droits réservés
    </p>

</div>
</body>
</html>